//   Brazil, on a continuous land with a single language, is the largest country in the world, Russia is only bigger because of Siberia (77% of Russian territory) and is made up of 22 Republics, where Russians are minorities in 21, but who chose to remain in the Russian Federation (Russia + 21 countries invaded and forcibly Russified) after the end of the USSR, without Siberia (a region with its own peoples, languages ​​and cultures, annexed by Russia) is less than half the size of Brazil.

 1. Brazil

 2. Canadá without Québec (French language)

 3. USA without Alaska (does not border the USA)

 4. China without Tibet (China invaded this Tibetan-speaking country in 1950)

 5. Australia

 6. Russian Federation without Siberia

 7. India

 //   Brazil is the only one of the 7 largest countries in the world (Russia, Canadá, USA, China, Austrália, India) that does not have deserts 

  //   and is also the only one of the 5 largest countries in the world (Russia, Canada, USA, China) that does not suffer from intense cold on a continuous basis ((blizzard (snow storm) interrupting day-to-day life in cities, accumulation of meters of snow, etc)).

 //   Brazil also does not suffer from ""true extreme heat"" (as may eventually occur in the USA, Europe, Asia, Africa, Oceania), in ""some places"' in many countries the temperature can easily pass 50°C, for example: Death Valley in California (USA) 56.7°C, Libya 56°C, Tunisia 55°C, Mali 54.44°C, Israel 54°C, Pakistan 53.5°C, Australia 50.7°C, Qatar 50°C, and a few other countries.

 //   In Brazil, 40 degrees of heat can occur in specific regions during occasional heat waves.  But, in general, it is "very rare" to reach 40°C or -0°C.  There will always be temperate, warmer and colder regions.  Where I live (mountain region near Poços de Caldas) the temperature measured during a heat wave was 27 degrees while in another city 100 kilometers away (Alfenas) it was 35 degrees.  (The record for the highest temperature ever officially recorded in Brazil was broken on November 4 and 5, 2020, in Nova Maringá (MT), with a temperature of 44.8°C. The previous record was 44.7° C in Bom Jesus (PI), on 11/21/2005.)

  //   Brazil is the only large country in the world that does not have tectonic plates that cause earthquakes, Russia, Canada, USA, China, Australia, India has up to 5 tectonic plates.

 //   Brazil is (almost a miracle because of its immense size) free of ""major catastrophes"" caused by Nature such as: tornadoes, hurricanes, volcanoes, tsunamis (because it is south of the Atlantic Ocean, far from the Pacific Ocean), earthquakes collapsing buildings, etc, etc.

 (In southern Brazil, excessively strong winds can occur, but nothing compared to the destructive Tornadoes (up to 420/500km per hour) in the northern hemisphere).

 //   Furthermore, we have lived in peace with the 10 neighboring countries since 1870, more than 150 years (this leaves Europeans, Africans and Asians impressed) when the last ""official war"" with neighboring Paraguay ended. 

(Unlike the United States, China and Russia, the Brazilian army has never invaded another country to annex territory. (Brazil, since independence, has resolved all territorial disputes with neighboring countries through diplomacy, with international agreements and arbitration.)

// Brazil is also the country with the most available habitable land and also the country with the most land available for agriculture, we use only 7.6% of the land (satellite data) for agriculture, while some countries can exceed 40% of the territory.

 //   Brazilians have the privilege of our country being far from problematic countries (that can be attacked) such as Russia, China, USA, Iran, North Korea, Afghanistan, Syria, Israel, Pakistan, countries in civil war in Africa, etc.

((It is only a geographical curiosity, it does not mean that Brazil is better than other countries, everyone should love their own countries.))

